%% Sequence: Search opportunity → Pipeline entry promotion + persistence.

sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant RP as "[D-20] ResearchPage"
    participant DR as "[D-21] createPipelineEntryDraft"
    participant PS as "[D-22] pipelineStore.addEntry"
    participant SP as "[D-30] schedulePersist (150ms)"
    participant Run as "[D-31] persistCurrentState"
    participant Snap as "[D-32] createWorkspaceSnapshotFromStores"
    participant DB as "[D-34] IndexedDB"

    User->>RP: click "Push to Pipeline"
    RP->>DR: createPipelineEntryDraft(entry, vectorId)
    DR-->>RP: PipelineEntry draft
    RP->>PS: addPipelineEntry(pipelineEntry)
    Note over PS: Zustand mutation triggers subscribe()
    PS->>SP: schedulePersist()
    Note over SP: clearSaveTimer + setTimeout(150ms)
    SP->>Run: persistCurrentState()
    Run->>Snap: coordinator.exportWorkspaceSnapshot()
    Snap-->>Run: FacetWorkspaceSnapshot
    Run->>DB: backend.saveWorkspaceSnapshot(snapshot)
    DB-->>Run: persisted
